
### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "newuser",
    "email": "newuser@example.com",
    "password": "123"
}

### Login with the new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "newuser@example.com",
    "password": "123"
}
